<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>ParkEasy — Reset Code</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #111114;
            color: #F0EFF8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 480px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #1C1C21;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 32px;
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1D9E75;
        }

        .otp {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 12px;
            color: #1D9E75;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }

        .note {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #9998A8;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #5C5B6E;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 32px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">🅿 ParkEasy</div>
        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
        <p>Your password reset code is:</p>
        <div class="otp">{{otp}}</div>
        <p class="note">This code expires in <strong>15 minutes</strong>. Do not share it with anyone.</p>
        <p class="note">If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        <div class="footer">© 2026 ParkEasy Inc.</div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>